ranger obviously my arrows were far more useful. Great so it's time to
make a run for that luckstone. I go down, and it's dark. "You hear a
thud. You hear a clank" or something. I'm like oh crap it must be a
bones level.

I go a few more steps and see a stethoscope on the ground. "That's
interesting" I think. Then I freeze. This is not just any bones level,
